2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.telusplanet.net/public/jdill/pafg142.htm#2726
2 CONT
2 CONT Ola Jonsen [Parents] was born in 1755 in Rundhaugen, Rana, Nordland, Norway. He died on 30 Jun 1820 in Rundhaugen, Rana, Nordland, Norway. He married Beret Andersdatter in 1783 in Rundhaugen, North Rana, Mo Prgjld., Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Beret Andersdatter [Parents] was born in 1759 in Næverneset, Rana, Nordland, Norway. She was christened on 12 Apr 1761 in Mo, Nordland, Norway. She died on 21 Jul 1841 in Rundhaugen, Rana, Nordland, Norway. She married Ola Jonsen 
2 CONC in 1783 in Rundhaugen, North Rana, Mo Prgjld., Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT    F i Katrine Olsdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT    F ii Elen Olsdatter was born in 1788 in Rundhaugen, Rana, Nordland, Norway.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    F iii Susanna Marie Olsdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT    F iv Stenetta Olsdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT    F v Andrine Olsdatter was born in 1793 in Rundhaugen, Rana, Nordland, Norway. She died in 1797 in Rundhaugen, Rana, Nordland, Norway.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    M vi Israel Olsen 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M vii Anders Olsen was born in 1798 in Rundhaugen, Rana, Nordland, Norway. He died in 1823 in Rundhaugen, Rana, Nordland, Norway.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    F viii Maria Marin Olsdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M ix Jon Olsen 
2 CONT
2 CONT    F x Rebeka Olsdatter 
2 CONT **************************
