2 CONT
2 CONT '''Manntallet 1701''': [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041010283064]
2 CONT NOTE: It may be that Christen Andersen (52aar), Jacob Andersen (54aar) and Jens Andersen (50aar) were brothers.
2 CONT Another: Borger Andersen Dalosen (f~1660?), 1700 Tingbok case: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/28719/17
2 CONT Then these 2 brothers: https://www.geni.com/people/Niels-Andersen-Dalsvog/6000000220968370930?through=6000000220968624835 (1696-1756) and his brother https://www.geni.com/people/Mons-Andersen-Dalosen/6000000220968624835
2 CONT
