2 GIVN Johan Jørgensen
2 SURN
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1626
2 ADDR
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1711
2 PLAC Udland
2 ADDR
