1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Folketellingen 1801 for Taavær i Alstahaug: Huusbonde Ole Benjaminsen 33 aar i 2dt ekteskap med Berith Andersdatter 20 år, hennes første ekteskap, med sønnen Lorentz Andreas  3 år fra hans første ekteskap bosatt i 
2 CONC Taavær som bonde og gårdbeboer. Far til Anders Johan i følge Tjøtta i Tjøtta minestrialbok 1862-1877, side 201, sønnen gift 10. oktober 1865. Undersøkt av Dag Marius Hestvik.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fra Descendants of Ole Benjaminsen and the Øverstua on Tåvær av Jim Willhite (2011): He was a farmer and he was born in 1766 at Bru, Velfjord, Nordland, Norway. He went to Tåvær, a little island which lies at the Helgeland coast b
2 CONC etween Vega and Tjøtta, in 1792 from Velfjord. In 1793 the family home was built and is still standing. He married Anne Dorothea Jensdatter on 7 jan 1798 at Tjøtta and she died May 1800. They had two children. He married Berith An
2 CONC dersdatter on 16 nov 1800 at Alstahaug, Nordland, Norway and they had eight children. He appeared on the census of 1801 at Tåvær. He died on 19 Apr 1832 at Tåvær. His estate was probaled on 31 Oct 1832 at Nordland, Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.slekt.net/tng/getperson.php?personID=I30761&tree=1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Descendants of Ole BENJAMENSEN and the Øverstuå on Tåvær''' http://www.overstua.no/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/History.pdf
