2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Skifte  Taperskar; Moe/1744
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Andersen      M                    Hovedperson
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Nielsdatter    K                    Ektefelle
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels Andersen       M        19          Sønn; Formynder Ole Christensen, Grønfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Andersen      M        17          Sønn; Formynder Erich Olsen,  Brennaasen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Zacharias Andersen   M        14          Sønn; Formynder Johan Augustinusen, Berg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ørger Andersen       M        7           Sønn; Formynder Johan Augustinusen, Berg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marithe Andersdatter K        20          Datter; Formynder Ole Christensen,  Grønfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dordi Andersdatter   K        12          Datter; Formynder Niels,   Storbechmoen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kiersten  Andersdatter         K        9           Datter; Formynder Erich Olsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Andersdatter    K        8           Datter; Formynder Erich Olsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kari Andersdatter    K        2           Datter; Formynder moderen.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT The rest of the kids can be found here:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.telusplanet.net/public/jdill/pafg95.htm#2911
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Andersen [Parents] was born in 1697 in Berg, Rana, Nordland, Norway. He died in 1744 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway. He married Karen Nilsdatter in 1722.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Other marriages:
2 CONT
2 CONT         Nilsdatter, Karen
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Nilsdatter [Parents] was born in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway. She died in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway. She married Anders Andersen in 1722.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	i 	Marit Andersdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	ii 	Nils Andersen
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	iii 	Anders Andersen
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	iv 	Steffen Andersen was born in 1727 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway. He died in 1727 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	v 	Beret Andersdatter was born in 1728 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	vi 	Sakarias Andersen was born in 1730 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	vii 	Dordi Andersdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	viii 	Kirsti Andersdatter was born in 1734 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway. She died in 1757 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	ix 	Ane Andersdatter was born in 1735 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	x 	Ørje Andersen was born in 1738 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT       		F 	xi 	Karen Andersdatter was born in 1742 in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway. She died in Skardet, Rana, Nordland, Norway. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Anders giftet seg med Karen Nilsdatter, datter av Nils Ørjansen og Enkefru Bertel Brennaas, den 18 Okt 1722 i Mo, Rana, Nordland. (Karen Nilsdatter ble født ca. 1700 i Tapperskar, Vefsn, Nordland.)
