1 NAME Hans /Larsen/ Storalteren
2 GIVN Hans
2 SURN Larsen
2 NSFX Storalteren
2 _MARNM Larsen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 13 APR 1816
2 PLAC Stor-Alteren
2 ADDR
