1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Østen Erikson of Granheia, born c. 1646, was a member of the House of Godwin as a patrilineal descendant of Godwin, Regent of England, Earl of Wessex, Earl of Kent through Godwin's son Tostig, Earl of Northumbria. 
2 CONC Tostig's son Ketil Hook (Kjetil Krok) immigrated to Norway in 1067, establishing an aristocratic dynasty at Torgar in Brønnøy—from which the Granheia family derives.
2 CONT
2 CONT The lineage from Earl Godwin to the Granheia family is outlined in the following book:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.lulu.com/shop/andre-vii-martinsen/but-the-godwins-werent-dead/hardcover/product-w4zqjjr.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Prestemanntallet 1666, 19 år''': [https://media.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041005203038]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Manntallet 1701''': [http://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/gen/vis/206/pc00000000661320]
2 CONT
2 CONT ØSTEN ERICHSEN D.E.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bruker Granheia ca. 1700-1709. Fødselsår oppgis til å være 1645 og 1647
2 CONT
2 CONT To barn: Erich og Eli
2 CONT
2 CONT Kan Erich Østensen Født 1625, Granheia være faren?
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Søsken:  Ola Erichsen f. 1647 Michel Erichsen f. 1656
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn: Eli Østensdatter: f. 1682 - 1765 Erich Østensen. f. 1683 - 1765
